                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It doesn't do anything that other games like this haven't. It feels like a more clunky version of clash royale with a sci-fi mod slapped on top of it. It's really hard to devote myself to this when there is a superior alternative and it just feels like a cash grab on an old trend. I thought the robot bases was quite an interesting touch but it feels way too gimmicky for my tastes ontop of it being super Pay to win. When I first started the game the specs were on MAXIMUM and since I'm not using a high-end PC I was getting 2 to 3 fps by average and I couldn't change it because there was a tutorial at the beginning. Waiting through intense lag to get past the damn tutorial on a game I already know how to play because it ripped off a better title for a quick buck left a sour taste in my mouth and was a complete waste of my time. If you want to play a Good innovative and engaging game I encourage you to look elsewhere.",
